here’s the updated code with random positioning, sizing, and rotation - it’ll jitter around the screen on load. the transition’s set to 0.5s ease, so it’ll slide and spin smoothly into place. if you wanna tweak the animation speed or style, just mess with the `transition` property in the CSS.

